  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "source": "The taxi policy is established to:",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 2.2662104006252988,
        "128": 4.473094408162122,
        "256": 6.196751296748372
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5088586280924821,
      "cosine_response": 0.4190122145314237
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "source": "- Ensure the transportation needs of VNG employees to complete the Company's work efficiently.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 0.0,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 0.0
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.36345409661190115,
      "cosine_response": 0.43533630101264037
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "source": "- Centralize management and ensure on-time payment to service providers.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": -0.0,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 0.0
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.2603997331640046,
      "cosine_response": 0.3567821399769403
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "source": "The support allowance depends on the job level, specifically regulated as follows:",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 1.3855123286747157,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 0.0
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.35752524095390853,
      "cosine_response": 0.4667042555386564
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "source": "| Level | Allowance (VND/month) |\n|---|---:|\n| 4.2 | 4,500,000 |\n| 4.1 |  |\n| 3.3 | 3,000,000 |\n| 3.2 |  |\n| 3.1 |  |\n| 2.3 | 1,500,000 |",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 0.0,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 1.7640425330989253
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.3325905189179371,
      "cosine_response": 0.5272034846353058
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "source": "- For newly joined Employees, AF will grant access to the Company's Grab account and send login and usage instructions within 03 working days from the start date.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 6.061750588732911,
        "128": 9.005383786635202,
        "256": 8.740006048896738
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.286184270871949,
      "cosine_response": 0.5085292432978988
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "source": "- For traditional taxis, AF will issue a taxi card within 10–14 days from the date the Employee submits the request.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 4.149831314024067,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 0.5015455276293521
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.4124744401599624,
      "cosine_response": 0.4914675487296988
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "source": "- If the actual monthly card usage cost is lower than the entitled allowance, the difference will not be refunded. Depending on the actual monthly card usage cost, any amount exceeding the entitled allowance will be deducted from that month's salary.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 35.736702113433125,
        "128": 35.64420714486689,
        "256": 37.395371469407756
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.3450146417480677,
      "cosine_response": 0.47149246067277073
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "source": "- In case of using a personal car, the Employee can request to convert the Taxi Support into a cash-only car allowance added to their monthly salary.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 15.896974892016575,
        "128": 7.826222692540266,
        "256": 10.048540814170899
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5389385586027059,
      "cosine_response": 0.5665584597035713
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "source": "Depending on the level or job requirements being undertaken, the Company provides a Taxi Allowance to Employees starting from the month they join the Company.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": -0.0,
        "128": -0.0,
        "256": -0.0
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5568009100276746,
      "cosine_response": 0.5618296066115329
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "source": "Relevant details are regulated in the Taxi Support Policy issued by the AF department.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": -0.0,
        "128": -2.3394131902605295,
        "256": -5.860195616092659
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5181444323406691,
      "cosine_response": 0.5133044453044295
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "source": "In case an Employee is promoted, the taxi allowance will take effect from the month following the effective promotion month.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 36.46148903529548,
        "128": 33.25730725365438,
        "256": 30.16395274041581
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5473122813460127,
      "cosine_response": 0.5808106186542283
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "source": "Employees are provided with a taxi card or a taxi app account pre-linked to the Company's payment account.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": -0.0,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 0.0
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.47247548390244976,
      "cosine_response": 0.511637985740703
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "source": "- [Garbled text/Prefix], when a new job level is adjusted, the AF department will proceed to issue taxi cards to Employees according to the allowance regulated in section 2.3.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 0.0,
        "128": 0.0,
        "256": 0.0
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5891129443714551,
      "cosine_response": 0.579612980388075
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "source": "- The provision of Taxi Allowance support according to the newly adjusted job level is regulated as follows:",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 0.0,
        "128": -0.0,
        "256": -0.878112292928223
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5353773829954425,
      "cosine_response": 0.5784554878835749
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "source": "  - New level effective date from the 01st to the 20th of the month: receive support from the effective month.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 30.07776165008545,
        "128": 31.39980845052969,
        "256": 26.179031051972295
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.2875617051789466,
      "cosine_response": 0.4945050812913382
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "source": "  - New level effective date from the 21st to the 31st of the month: receive support from the following month.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": 9.374186649144104,
        "128": 3.3963869313021324,
        "256": 8.922333845757501
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.27583505529698793,
      "cosine_response": 0.4928045112975816
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "source": "- For cases of job level adjustment with a backdated effective date, the Taxi Allowance applied in previous months will not be recalculated.",
      "context_cite": {
        "64": -0.0,
        "128": -7.714008147674772,
        "256": -1.2825775939448798
      },
      "cosine_query": 0.5022939242216752,
      "cosine_response": 0.5323826985805451
    }
